        en: { name: 'Salling Rooftop', description: 'A terrace and café on top of the Salling department store, with views over tiled roofs, the cathedral and the harbour.', tip: 'Take the lift from the ground floor and have coffee and cake on the terrace towards sunset; on fine days arrive at opening to get a spot. Cards accepted.' },
