        en: { name: 'Amalienborg Square and the Marble Church', description: 'An octagonal square with the royal family’s four palaces and an equestrian statue at the centre, from which the axis of Amaliegade frames the dome of the Marble Church.', tip: 'Stand on the Amaliegade axis or by the statue so the dome sits directly behind you; early morning the square is empty, and at noon the guard change brings a crowd.' },
