        en: { name: 'Møllestien', description: 'A cobbled lane of low pastel eighteenth-century houses with hollyhocks blooming along the walls in summer, Aarhus’s prettiest street.', tip: 'Shoot along the lane from its lower end in July and August when the hollyhocks are in bloom; it is quiet before 10:00, and light clothes stand out against the pastels. People live here, so keep your voice down.' },
